#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059484 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Integer Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "79841c0d-e191-566b-8fe2-63828dcfc23a" :question/math-academy-id "e-4439" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry $b_{21}$ in the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 8 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of $b_{21} = 3$ (second row, first column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $3$ are removed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & 1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of $b_{21}=3$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{vmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 2\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 1 \\cdot 2 - 5 \\cdot 7 \\\\\n&= 2 - 35 \\\\\n&=-33\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059485 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Variable Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "51f60726-3d12-507e-b942-5d316fc28bd0" :question/math-academy-id "e-4440" :question/problem "What is the minor of $c_{22}$ in the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}7x & 0 & -3y \\\\ 1 & x + 2y & 4 \\\\ -y & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and second column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}7x & ∗ & -3y \\\\ ∗ & x + 2 y & ∗ \\\\ -y & ∗ & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet\\begin{bmatrix}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{vmatrix}7x & -3y \\\\ -y & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 7x \\cdot 5 - (-3y) \\cdot (-y) \\\\\n&= 35x - 3y^{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059486 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4aa65a73-e750-5052-9249-7c096297ae51" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown Given the Value of a Minor"}] :question/id #uuid "afd06762-0a78-5559-b035-98bd05e6c084" :question/math-academy-id "e-4441" :question/problem "Given that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5$, find all the possible values of $k$ in the matrix\n$\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & -6\\end{bmatrix}$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the second row and third column:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & ∗\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe minor of $a_{23}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet\\begin{bmatrix}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{vmatrix}k & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2k\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= k \\cdot 2k - 3 \\cdot (-1) \\\\\n&= 2k^{2} + 3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe're told that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5$, so we must have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n2k^{2} + 3 &= 5 \\\\\n2k^{2} &= 2 \\\\\nk^{2} &= 1 \\\\\nk &= ± 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=-1$ and $k=1$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059911 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Minor in a 3x3 Matrix With Variable Entries"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a3c0a4da-b48c-57f2-8331-f599d27a61ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-r - 5rt" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056186} {:answer/id #uuid "151ec30f-0156-58b5-b5ae-8bd06ff80ea3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-r^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056187} {:answer/id #uuid "26b9af6a-74f1-5cf0-9e37-e7285876a3e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r^{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056188} {:answer/id #uuid "292a37f8-50f6-5675-bca0-8ebaa9dcbf4b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4r^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056189} {:answer/id #uuid "6c561c2c-0c10-5e3a-afb2-8c5ce5d0cce6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3rs + 2rt" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056190}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c561c2c-0c10-5e3a-afb2-8c5ce5d0cce6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3rs + 2rt" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056190} :answer-field/id #uuid "37846d32-b064-507f-be21-ccc91075858f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186056185}] :question/id #uuid "47a0f2fd-6622-508d-a61d-a108ebab293f" :question/math-academy-id "q-1099" :question/problem "What is the minor of $d_{32}$ in the matrix\n\n$D = \\begin{bmatrix}3s & -r^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{bmatrix}$?"}]}
